  "wikitext": "{{PageDisplay}}\n[[File:Cheesecake.png|200px|left|Cheesecake]]\n\n{{Infobox\n |title = [[Products|Product]]\n |level = 24\n |price = 1 to 284\n |time = 4 h\n |source ={{Infoicon|Cakeo|bigger|link=Cake Oven}}\n |xp = 34\n |base = 79\n |time3 = 3 h 24 min\n |dia = 6\n|rlevel=|needs=|lures=|spots=|circle=|slots=|seats=|cost=|houses=|upgrades=|size=|walkin=|auto=}}\n'''Cheesecakes''' are [[products]] unlocked at [[experience]] level 24.\n\nLike all [[products]], they are stored in the [[barn]].\n\n{{Clr}}----\n==='''Making cheesecakes'''===\n[[File:Cake Oven.png|150px|left|Cake Oven]]\nCheesecakes are made in the [[Cake Oven]].\n\nTo make a cheesecake, players need the following ingredients, in the specified quantities:\n{| border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"2\" cellspacing=\"1\" style=\"text-align: center; margin: .5em 0;\"\n|-\n|[[File:Cheese.png|75px|Cheese|link=Cheese]]\n|[[File:Cookie.png|75px|Cookie|link=Cookie]]\n|-\n|'''x1'''\n|'''x1'''\n|}\nIt takes 4 hours to make one cake, and 3 hours 24 minutes in a fully [[Masteries|mastered]] oven. Each cake gives players 34 [[experience]] points.\n\n{{Clr}}----\n==='''Selling cheesecakes'''===\n[[File:Roadside Shop.png|150px|left|Roadside Shop]]\n* Cheesecakes can be bought or sold for a maximum price of 2,844 {{Infoicon|Coin}} for 10 cakes.\n* Buying the ingredients required to make a cake costs 226 {{Infoicon|Coin}}.\n\n{{Clr}}----\n\n==='''Using Cheesecake'''===\nCheesecake is used to make the following [[products|product]]:\n\n{{Item Usage|Cheesecake\n|Blueberry Cheesecake|1|31\n}}\n{{Clr}}----\n==='''Boat orders'''===\n[[File:Riverboat.png|150px|left|Riverboat]]\n* [[Boat]] orders ask for 2 cheesecakes per crate, up to a total of 8 per boat.\n\n{{Clr}}----\n==='''Strategy tips'''===\n* Cheesecakes can hardly ever be found in the [[Daily Dirt]].\n* Since cheesecakes take so long to make, it would be a good idea to make them at night by filling up your queue with them.\n----\n\n{{Navigation}}\n{{Languages\n|de = Käsetorte\n|es = Pastel de queso\n|fr = Cheesecake\n|it = Cheesecake\n|nl = Kwarktaart\n|no = Ostekake\n|ru = Чизкейк\n|vi = Cheesecake\n|zh = Cheesecake\n}}\n[[pt-br:Bolo de queijo]]\n\n[[Category:Cake Oven Products]]\n[[Category:Cookie Products]]\n[[Category:Cheese Products]]",
